{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>A woman of valor, who can find:</b> 'Valor' means wealth, as in: a woman who acquires valor and wealth through her wisdom — who can find." "<b>She sells:</b> From תמכרו (you [plural] sell)."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 31, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:25:48.581588054Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}